---

Bundled wordlist data (AZ-LetterProofer.glyphsPlugin/Contents/Resources/data/wordlists/)
is derived from the FrequencyWords project
(https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords, OpenSubtitles 2018 corpus) and is
licensed separately under CC-BY-SA 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/). The lists were modified by
filtering to alphabetic words of 3-11 characters and truncating to the 20,000
most frequent entries per language. Derivatives of the wordlist data must be
shared under the same license.

---

Bundled orthography data (AZ-LetterProofer.glyphsPlugin/Contents/Resources/data/orthographies.json)
is derived from Hyperglot by Rosetta (https://github.com/rosettatype/hyperglot), licensed
under the Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). It was modified
by keeping, for each bundled language, the letters of every orthography's base and
auxiliary alphabets.

---

The bundled surface texture (AZ-LetterProofer.glyphsPlugin/Contents/Resources/assets/Roughness.jpg)
is from AmbientCG (https://ambientcg.com), released under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 license
(public domain): the Plastic015A roughness map, downsampled to 640px.
